<section class="col-md-6"><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2 class="h4">Atendimento / Despacho</h2><p class="text-muted">Comandas enviadas ao despacho são recebidas automaticamente na fila para conferência, complementos, pagamento e saída para entrega.</p><ul class="list-group"><?php foreach(array_filter($commands, fn($c)=>$c['status']==='despacho') as $command): ?><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between"><span>#<?= e($command['command_number']) ?> · <?= e($command['assembler_name']) ?></span><span class="badge text-bg-success"><?= e($command['dispatch_status'] ?: 'aguardando') ?></span></li><?php endforeach ?></ul></div></div></section>
